#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/install_morpheus.rst:2
msgid "Install VME Manager / Worker"
msgstr "VME Manager / Worker installieren"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/install_morpheus.rst:4
msgid ""
"The **Install VME Manager** and **Install VME Worker** options deploy a "
"Morpheus appliance VM directly on the HVM host. This is the primary "
"deployment method on HVM OS 24.04."
msgstr ""
"Die Optionen **Install VME Manager** und **Install VME Worker** stellen eine "
"Morpheus-Appliance-VM direkt auf dem HVM-Host bereit. Dies ist die primäre "
"Bereitstellungsmethode unter HVM OS 24.04."

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/install_morpheus.rst:6
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Hinweis"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/install_morpheus.rst:6
msgid ""
"On HVM OS 26.04+, use the "
":doc:`/getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer` (GUI) or "
"``hvmcli deploy`` (CLI) instead."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie unter HVM OS 26.04+ stattdessen den "
":doc:`/getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer` (GUI) oder "
"``hvmcli deploy`` (CLI)."

